  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call upon your dragonmark's power to forewarn your target of impending danger. When you cast the spell, the target gains a +1 status bonus to initiative rolls and isn't off-guard against undetected creatures. This bonus remains as long as you Sustain the Spell. The target is temporarily immune to Detect Danger for 1 hour.</p>\n<hr />\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You do not need to sustain Detect Danger.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The bonus increases to +2.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The duration is sustained up to 1 hour.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\"><strong>Heightened (9th)</strong> The bonus increases to +3.</p>\n<p class=\"hang\">@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-effects.jm2Pn6sMtPgGdR8p]{Spell Effect: Detect Danger}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pathfinders-guide-to-eberron.eberron-effects.EffDetectDangImm]{Effect: Detect Danger Immunity}</p>"
    },
